# ANRI Model Interface v0.1


## Purpose

The model interface separates ANRI core architecture
from specific AI foundation models.


## Design Principle

Models are replaceable.

ANRI depends on capabilities,
not specific model providers.


## Required Capabilities


### Reasoning

Ability to perform engineering reasoning.


### Tool Use

Ability to interact with:

- simulation tools
- databases
- engineering software


### Structured Output

Ability to generate:

- parameters
- decisions
- explanations


### Self Evaluation

Ability to analyze uncertainty and limitations.


## Future Compatibility

The interface should support:

- commercial foundation models
- open-source models
- domain-specific models
- future advanced AI systems
